movement that meets people where they are, every week in Montreal.</div></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Hi {{first_name|there}},</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Thank you for signing up. Food is our starting point: it opens the conversation, builds trust, and connects people with the support they need. You are part of that now.</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:4px 0 22px;"><tr><td style="padding:0;"><img src="https://zwnmulmnvopclzcvytce.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-images/photos/web/2024-07-summer-team-under-the-tent.jpg?v=1" width="528" alt="Thirteen volunteers in green Welfare Avenue vests under the green tent in a leafy park" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:528px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px;"></td></tr></table><div style="font-family:''Barlow Condensed'',''Arial Narrow'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:26px;line-height:28px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#103F39;padding:10px 0 0;">How a serving works</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 14px;"><tr><td style="width:40px;height:3px;background-color:#DCA527;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 18px;"><tr><td style="padding:3px 12px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;width:10px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:5px;background-color:#DCA527;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1F201E;padding:3px 0;"><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">Cooks</strong> make a dish for 30 to 35 people from our recipe book.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:3px 12px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;width:10px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:5px;background-color:#6F64AB;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1F201E;padding:3px 0;"><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">Drivers</strong> bring the food and the supplies to the serving.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:3px 12px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;width:10px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:5px;background-color:#103F39;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1F201E;padding:3px 0;"><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">Servers</strong> set up, serve, and take the time to talk with the people we serve.</td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Pick a Sunday that works for you. Before it, we send you where to meet and what to bring.</p><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" align="center" style="margin:10px auto 6px;"><tr><td style="background-color:#DCA527;border-radius:6px;" align="center"><a style="display:inline-block;padding:15px 34px;font-family:''Barlow Condensed'',''Arial Narrow'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:20px;line-height:22px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#103F39;text-decoration:none;" href="https://welfareavenue.com/volunteer/" target="_blank">Pick your first Sunday</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6F64AB;text-align:center;">Your volunteer hours count for school and work.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Warmly,<br><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">The Welfare Avenue team</strong></p>', 'Welcome to Welfare Avenue

WELCOME TO THE CREW

You just joined a youth-powered movement that meets people where they are, every week in Montreal.

Hi {{first_name|there}},

Thank you for signing up. Food is our starting point: it opens the conversation, builds trust, and connects people with the support they need. You are part of that now.

HOW A SERVING WORKS

- Cooks make a dish for 30 to 35 people from our recipe book.
- Drivers bring the food and the supplies to the serving.
- Servers set up, serve, and take the time to talk with the people we serve.

Pick a Sunday that works for you. Before it, we send you where to meet and what to bring.

Pick your first Sunday: https://welfareavenue.com/volunteer/
Your volunteer hours count for school and work.

Warmly,
The Welfare Avenue team', '["first_name"]'::jsonb, true, 200, 'starter', now(), '{"v":1,"blocks":[{"id":"bwelcom0","type":"hero","style":"cream","kicker":"Welcome to Welfare Avenue","lines":["Welcome to","the crew"],"lead":"You just joined a youth-powered movement that meets people where they are, every week in Montreal.","doodle":"heart","accent":"gold","moveE":true},{"id":"bwelcom1","type":"text","text":"Hi {{first_name|there}},\n\nThank you for signing up. Food is our starting point: it opens the conversation, builds trust, and connects people with the support they need. You are part of that now."},{"id":"bwelcom2","type":"photo","src":"https://zwnmulmnvopclzcvytce.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-images/photos/web/2024-07-summer-team-under-the-tent.jpg?v=1","alt":"Thirteen volunteers in green Welfare Avenue vests under the green tent in a leafy park","caption":"","link":"","lib":"photo:29"},{"id":"bwelcom3","type":"heading","text":"How a serving works"},{"id":"bwelcom4","type":"list","items":[{"lead":"Cooks","text":"make a dish for 30 to 35 people from our recipe book."},{"lead":"Drivers","text":"bring the food and the supplies to the serving."},{"lead":"Servers","text":"set up, serve, and take the time to talk with the people we serve."}]},{"id":"bwelcom5","type":"text","text":"Pick a Sunday that works for you. Before it, we send you where to meet and what to bring."},{"id":"bwelcom6","type":"button","label":"Pick your first Sunday","url":"https://welfareavenue.com/volunteer/","caption":"Your volunteer hours count for school and work."},{"id":"bwelcom7","type":"signoff","closing":"Warmly,","name":"The Welfare Avenue team","role":"","ps":""}],"source":"starter"}'::jsonb, false, 'volunteers', 'volunteers_welcome', 'en', 'The first email a new volunteer gets: how a Sunday works and how to pick their first one. Ready for an automation (a form sign-up).', 'starter', now()) on conflict (key) do update set name = excluded.name, kind = excluded.kind, subject = excluded.subject, preheader = excluded.preheader, html_body = excluded.html_body, text_body = excluded.text_body, vars = excluded.vars, sort = excluded.sort, design = excluded.design, audience = excluded.audience, category = excluded.category, description = excluded.description, updated_by = excluded.updated_by, updated_at = now() where public.crm_email_templates.created_by = 'starter';
