nt-size:15px;line-height:22px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #E6DFD3;padding:10px 0;color:#6F64AB;">{{role|A volunteer}}</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #E6DFD3;padding:10px 14px 10px 0;width:34%;font-weight:700;color:#103F39;">Where to meet</td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #E6DFD3;padding:10px 0;color:#6F64AB;">{{event_location|In the text we send you the day before}}</td></tr><tr><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #E6DFD3;padding:10px 14px 10px 0;width:34%;font-weight:700;color:#103F39;">Bring</td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:22px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #E6DFD3;padding:10px 0;color:#6F64AB;">Comfortable shoes, clothes for the weather and a water bottle</td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:0 0 18px;"><tr><td style="padding:3px 12px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;width:10px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:5px;background-color:#DCA527;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1F201E;padding:3px 0;"><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">Come ten minutes early</strong> so the team leader can walk you through the day.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:3px 12px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;width:10px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:5px;background-color:#6F64AB;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1F201E;padding:3px 0;"><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">First time?</strong> You will be paired with someone who has done it before.</td></tr><tr><td style="padding:3px 12px 3px 0;vertical-align:top;width:10px;"><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 0;"><tr><td style="width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:5px;background-color:#103F39;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table></td><td style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1F201E;padding:3px 0;"><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">Questions?</strong> Reply to this email: a person reads it.</td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Can’t make it anymore? Reply and tell us, so we can find someone. No worries at all, it happens.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Warmly,<br><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">The Welfare Avenue team</strong></p>', '{{event_when|Your next serving}}

SEE YOU {{EVENT_DAY|SOON}}

You are down as {{role|a volunteer}} for {{event_title|our next serving}}. Thank you for giving your time to your community.

Hi {{first_name|there}},

A quick reminder before the day, so you have everything you need.

THE PLAN

When: {{event_when|See the serving page}}
Your role: {{role|A volunteer}}
Where to meet: {{event_location|In the text we send you the day before}}
Bring: Comfortable shoes, clothes for the weather and a water bottle

- Come ten minutes early so the team leader can walk you through the day.
- First time? You will be paired with someone who has done it before.
- Questions? Reply to this email: a person reads it.

Can’t make it anymore? Reply and tell us, so we can find someone. No worries at all, it happens.

Warmly,
The Welfare Avenue team', '["event_day","first_name","event_when","role","event_title","event_location"]'::jsonb, true, 201, 'starter', now(), '{"v":1,"blocks":[{"id":"bservin0","type":"hero","style":"cream","kicker":"{{event_when|Your next serving}}","lines":["See you","{{event_day|soon}}"],"lead":"You are down as **{{role|a volunteer}}** for {{event_title|our next serving}}. Thank you for giving your time to your community.","doodle":"star","accent":"gold","moveE":true,"gold":0},{"id":"bservin1","type":"text","text":"Hi {{first_name|there}},\n\nA quick reminder before the day, so you have everything you need."},{"id":"bservin2","type":"heading","text":"The plan"},{"id":"bservin3","type":"details","rows":[{"label":"When","value":"{{event_when|See the serving page}}"},{"label":"Your role","value":"{{role|A volunteer}}"},{"label":"Where to meet","value":"{{event_location|In the text we send you the day before}}"},{"label":"Bring","value":"Comfortable shoes, clothes for the weather and a water bottle"}]},{"id":"bservin4","type":"list","items":[{"lead":"Come ten minutes early","text":"so the team leader can walk you through the day."},{"lead":"First time?","text":"You will be paired with someone who has done it before."},{"lead":"Questions?","text":"Reply to this email: a person reads it."}]},{"id":"bservin5","type":"text","text":"Can’t make it anymore? Reply and tell us, so we can find someone. No worries at all, it happens."},{"id":"bservin6","type":"signoff","closing":"Warmly,","name":"The Welfare Avenue team","role":"","ps":""}],"source":"starter"}'::jsonb, false, 'volunteers', 'volunteers_welcome', 'en', 'A few days before someone serves: their role, the day, what to bring. Ready for a serving automation (it fills the day and the role).', 'starter', now()) on conflict (key) do update set name = excluded.name, kind = excluded.kind, subject = excluded.subject, preheader = excluded.preheader, html_body = excluded.html_body, text_body = excluded.text_body, vars = excl