ecific moment or number from the season.]</div></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Hi {{first_name|there}},</p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">[Open with what happened, plainly and specifically.]</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 24px;"><tr><td style="border-top:1px solid #E6DFD3;border-bottom:1px solid #E6DFD3;padding:20px 0 18px;"><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td colspan="3" align="center" style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:11px;line-height:14px;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6F64AB;padding:0 0 14px;">[This season]</td></tr><tr><td width="33%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding:0 6px;"><div style="font-family:''Barlow Condensed'',''Arial Narrow'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:40px;line-height:42px;color:#103F39;">[number]</div><div style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#1F201E;padding-top:6px;">meals served</div></td><td width="33%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding:0 6px;"><div style="font-family:''Barlow Condensed'',''Arial Narrow'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:40px;line-height:42px;color:#103F39;">[number]</div><div style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#1F201E;padding-top:6px;">servings</div></td><td width="33%" align="center" valign="top" style="padding:0 6px;"><div style="font-family:''Barlow Condensed'',''Arial Narrow'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:40px;line-height:42px;color:#103F39;">[number]</div><div style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;color:#1F201E;padding-top:6px;">volunteers</div></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><div style="font-family:''Barlow Condensed'',''Arial Narrow'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:26px;line-height:28px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.5px;color:#103F39;padding:10px 0 0;">One story</div><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:8px 0 14px;"><tr><td style="width:40px;height:3px;background-color:#DCA527;font-size:0;line-height:0;">&nbsp;</td></tr></table><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:4px 0 22px;"><tr><td style="padding:0;"><img src="https://zwnmulmnvopclzcvytce.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/content-images/photos/web/2024-10-autumn-volunteers-plating.jpg?v=1" width="528" alt="Two volunteers plate food side by side" style="display:block;width:100%;max-width:528px;height:auto;border:0;border-radius:8px;"></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">[The story in a few sentences: who, what happened, what changed.]</p><table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:6px 0 22px;"><tr><td style="border-left:3px solid #6F64AB;padding:4px 0 4px 18px;"><p style="margin:0;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:18px;line-height:28px;color:#103F39;">[A line from a volunteer or a partner]</p><div style="font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;letter-spacing:1px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6F64AB;padding-top:8px;">[Their name and role]</div></td></tr></table><table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" borde