ue.com/donate/" target="_blank">Give today</a></td></tr></table><p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;color:#6F64AB;text-align:center;">Eligible gifts get an official tax receipt.</p><p style="margin:8px 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:26px;color:#1F201E;">Warmly,<br><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">[Who signs it]</strong><br><span style="color:#6F64AB;">Welfare Avenue</span></p><p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-family:''Space Grotesk'',''Helvetica Neue'',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:24px;color:#1F201E;"><strong style="color:#103F39;font-weight:700;">P.S.</strong> [One more reason to give, or the deadline]</p>', '[The campaign]

